Extract these fields from the customer's message and return JSON only:
policy_number (MOT-YYYY-NNNNNN), claimant_name, incident_date (YYYY-MM-DD), claim_amount (number in rupees; "1.2 lakh" = 120000, "45k" = 45000),
vehicle_reg (as written, e.g. "KA 05 MN 4521"), incident_type (one of collision, theft, fire, flood). Use null when a field is not present.
